      skos:note "When a memory contains an H1 heading that is explicitly named to signal it should not win, the pipeline must select the correct canonical title/slug via another mechanism (e.g., frontmatter id, LLM id-gen, or slugify fallback) rather than defaulting to the H1 text. This tests title-precedence ordering in the intake workflow." ;
